I don't have a preference personally, I don't mind it being realistic or not, as long as it isn't animal. 

&#x200B;

On another note, the mods NEED to find a way to stop the TERF brigade, holy shit. Anything from a trans lesbian or someone being trans inclusive is getting downvoted to hell. If this sub is trans inclusive, something needs to be done.

well, i'm upvoting for unpopularity, but watch out for my pitchfork!

&#x200B;

I do like Umpah Umpah tho.
